sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User

    participant Browser as Next.js Application
    participant API as Go API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Domain
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Auth Schema
    participant Redis as Redis


    User->>Browser: Enter email and password

    Browser->>API: POST /api/v2/auth/login

    API->>Auth: Authenticate User

    Auth->>DB: Find User Record

    DB-->>Auth: Return User Data

    Auth->>Auth: Verify Argon2id Password Hash

    Auth->>DB: Create User Session

    Auth->>Redis: Store Session Metadata

    Auth-->>API: Authentication Successful

    API-->>Browser: Set Secure HttpOnly Cookie


    Browser->>API: Request Protected Resource

    API->>Redis: Validate Session

    Redis-->>API: Session Valid

    API-->>Browser: Return Protected Resource